  "cmd_name": "merchandise-scene-detection",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Detects store displays based on display scene recognition and holistic positioning powered by multimodal large models. This product identifies display areas such as shelves, refrigerators, and floor displays, and outputs available scene names, locations, and display metrics. It also provides overall facility bounding boxes, making it suitable for display facility inspection, area visualization, and display metric verification",
  "description_zh": "基于陈列场景识别与多模态大模型整体定位构建的门店陈列检测产品。产品识别货架、冷柜、地堆等陈列区域，输出可用的场景名称、位置和陈列指标，并补充设施整体框，适用于陈列设施巡检、区域展示和陈列指标复核",
  "kebab_example": "",
  "method": "POST",
  "multi_version": false,
